A byte-level before/after delta for the MiniVic chunk is NOT reported here,
because no pre-change build artifact survived to measure against: out/ was first
built in this worktree after the ladder had already been removed, and
reconstructing the prior bundle would mean a second full build this lane's host
budget does not have. Rather than quote a number I did not measure, the size
claim rests on what is measured:

  - source: components/MiniVicBot.tsx  418 lines changed, net −319
            (git diff --stat: 139 insertions, 458 deletions across the two files)
  - bundle: MV-SEND-02 greps all 33 emitted chunks for 'api/realtime',
            'chat-with-vic' and 'polloTaskId' and finds zero — the reviewer
            measured the poller present in the served bundle before this change,
            and it is absent from it now.

Removed from the shipped component: sendRealtimeMessage (WebSocket session +
envelope protocol), the /api/chat-with-vic compatibility POST, the 3-second
task poller and its interval ref, liveSocketsRef and its teardown, wsBaseUrl,
isJsonResponse, formatProviderError, parseProviderErrorPayload, OFFLINE_MESSAGE,
the RealtimeServerEnvelope and ProviderErrorPayload types, the polloTaskId /
videoUrl message fields, playGeneratedVideo and the two unreachable UI branches
it fed, and the now-unused Video icon import.

